{"seq":2,"slug":"variational-inference","title":"变分推断","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/bayesian-data-analysis/computation/variational-inference","wordCount":1578,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"变分推断\">变分推断</h1><p><a href=\"mcmc\">MCMC 采样</a>给出渐近精确的后验，但有一个硬伤：慢。当数据有上亿条、模型有上百万参数（比如贝叶斯神经网络）时，让马尔可夫链跑到收敛可能要数天甚至根本不可行。变分推断换了一条完全不同的思路：不去抽样逼近后验，而是把推断变成一个优化问题——在一族容易处理的分布里，找一个最像真实后验的成员。这一思路用「只得近似」换来了数量级的加速，是大规模贝叶斯推断的主力。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>变分推断引入一族带参数的近似分布 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>ϕ</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q_\\phi(\\theta)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ϕ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>（变分族），目标是调整 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϕ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\phi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϕ</span></span></span></span></span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>ϕ</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q_\\phi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ϕ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 尽量接近真实后验 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p(\\theta \\mid D)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。「接近」用 KL 散度衡量。直接最小化 KL 需要那个算不出的证据，于是变分推断转而最大化一个等价的、可计算的目标——证据下界（ELBO）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>ϕ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>E</mi><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>ϕ</mi></msub></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>D</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>E</mi><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>ϕ</mi></msub></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>ϕ</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{ELBO}(\\phi) = E_{q_\\phi}[\\log p(D, \\theta)] - E_{q_\\phi}[\\log q_\\phi(\\theta)]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">ELBO</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϕ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1031em;vertical-align:-0.3531em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3488em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ϕ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2901em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3531em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1031em;vertical-align:-0.3531em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3488em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ϕ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2901em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3531em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ϕ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)]</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>最大化 ELBO 等价于最小化 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span> 与后验的 KL 散度。这样推断就变成了梯度上升——可以直接套用深度学习的全套优化工具（Adam、小批量、GPU）。下图对照 VI 与 MCMC 的根本路径差异。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    POST[真实后验 难以直接获得] --&gt; CHOICE{选择计算范式}&#10;    CHOICE --&gt;|采样| MC[MCMC&lt;br/&gt;构造链抽样&lt;br/&gt;渐近精确 但慢]&#10;    CHOICE --&gt;|优化| VI[变分推断&lt;br/&gt;族内找最近分布]&#10;    VI --&gt; Q[选变分族 q phi]&#10;    Q --&gt; OBJ[最大化 ELBO]&#10;    OBJ --&gt; OPT[梯度上升优化 phi]&#10;    OPT --&gt; APPROX[近似后验 q phi]&#10;    APPROX --&gt; NOTE[速度快 但只得近似]\">flowchart TD\n    POST[真实后验 难以直接获得] --&gt; CHOICE{选择计算范式}\n    CHOICE --&gt;|采样| MC[MCMC&lt;br/&gt;构造链抽样&lt;br/&gt;渐近精确 但慢]\n    CHOICE --&gt;|优化| VI[变分推断&lt;br/&gt;族内找最近分布]\n    VI --&gt; Q[选变分族 q phi]\n    Q --&gt; OBJ[最大化 ELBO]\n    OBJ --&gt; OPT[梯度上升优化 phi]\n    OPT --&gt; APPROX[近似后验 q phi]\n    APPROX --&gt; NOTE[速度快 但只得近似]</pre><p>下表把 VI 与 MCMC 的取舍并列，二者常常互补而非互斥。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>MCMC</th>\n<th>变分推断</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>范式</td>\n<td>采样</td>\n<td>优化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>精度</td>\n<td>渐近精确</td>\n<td>受限于变分族的近似</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>速度</td>\n<td>慢</td>\n<td>快（可达数量级提升）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可扩展性</td>\n<td>大数据/大模型吃力</td>\n<td>天然支持小批量、GPU</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>不确定性</td>\n<td>通常可靠</td>\n<td>常低估（尤其均场）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>收敛诊断</td>\n<td>R-hat、ESS 等成熟</td>\n<td>较弱，仍在发展</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"从-kl-散度到-elbo\">从 KL 散度到 ELBO</h2><p>为什么不直接最小化 KL 散度？因为 KL 散度的定义里含有真实后验，而后验正是我们算不出的东西（它需要证据这个归一化常数）。代数推导表明，对数证据 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\log p(D)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 等于 ELBO 加上 KL 散度。由于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\log p(D)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϕ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\phi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϕ</span></span></span></span></span> 无关的常数，最大化 ELBO 就自动最小化了 KL——而 ELBO 里只涉及联合分布 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>D</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>D</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p(D, \\theta) = p(D \\mid \\theta) p(\\theta)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 和我们自己选的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>ϕ</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q_\\phi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ϕ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，两者都可计算。这个「绕开证据」的代数技巧是整个变分推断的支点，名字里的「证据下界」也由此而来：ELBO 永远不超过对数证据。</p>\n<h2 id=\"均场近似及其代价\">均场近似及其代价</h2><p>最经典的变分族是均场近似：假设各参数在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span> 下相互独立，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>ϕ</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∏</mo><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mi>q</mi><msub><mi>ϕ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q_\\phi(\\theta) = \\prod_i q_{\\phi_i}(\\theta_i)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ϕ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0497em;vertical-align:-0.2997em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∏</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ϕ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3281em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。这让优化极其高效，但代价直接：它无法表达参数间的后验相关性。当真实后验的参数高度相关时（贝叶斯模型里很常见），均场近似会系统性地低估方差——给出的可信区间偏窄，让你对结论过度自信。这是 VI 最该警惕的失效模式，也是它在需要诚实不确定性的场景里不如 MCMC 可靠的根本原因，相关误用归入<a href=\"../practice/pitfalls\">陷阱与误用</a>。要缓解，就得用更灵活的变分族——这正是下面几项进展的动机。</p>\n<h2 id=\"advi-归一化流与-pathfinder\">ADVI、归一化流与 Pathfinder</h2><p>把变分推断变成「黑盒」可用工具的关键一步是自动微分变分推断（ADVI）。它把所有参数变换到无约束实数空间，默认用高斯变分族，再靠自动微分自动求 ELBO 梯度——用户只要写出模型，无需为每个模型手推变分更新。ADVI 让 VI 像 NUTS 一样开箱即用，被 <a href=\"probabilistic-programming\">Stan 和 PyMC</a> 集成。</p>\n<p>为突破均场和高斯族的表达力上限，归一化流变分族通过一串可逆变换把简单基分布（如标准高斯）逐步「揉」成复杂形状，能捕捉相关性与非高斯性，是当前研究热点。另一条实用路线是 Pathfinder：它沿优化轨迹快速定位后验的高密度区，给出近似样本，常被用作 MCMC 的智能初始化——先用 VI 廉价地找到大致位置，再用 <a href=\"mcmc\">MCMC</a> 精修，把两种范式的长处结合起来。</p>\n<p>下表把这几种变分方法按表达力与适用场景排开，从最简单到最灵活。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>变分族</th>\n<th>能否捕捉相关性</th>\n<th>典型用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>均场 ADVI</td>\n<td>独立高斯</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>快速粗估、基线</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>全秩 ADVI</td>\n<td>多元高斯</td>\n<td>是（线性）</td>\n<td>中等相关的后验</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>归一化流</td>\n<td>可逆变换链</td>\n<td>是（非线性）</td>\n<td>复杂非高斯后验</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pathfinder</td>\n<td>沿轨迹的高斯近似</td>\n<td>部分</td>\n<td>MCMC 初始化、快速探索</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"何时用-vi\">何时用 VI</h2><p>选择 VI 还是 MCMC，是一个关于「精度预算」和「计算预算」的权衡决策。当数据规模或模型规模让 MCMC 无法在可接受时间内收敛——典型如大规模文本主题模型、贝叶斯深度学习、需要实时更新的在线系统——VI 往往是唯一现实选项。当样本量适中、精度（尤其是不确定性的诚实度）至关重要、计算预算充足时，MCMC 仍是首选。两者也可拼接：VI 做初始化或快速探索，MCMC 做最终精修。无论用哪个，得到近似后验后，<a href=\"../foundations/posterior-inference\">后验推断</a>里那套从样本提取结论的方法依然适用——区别只在样本来源和可信度。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>变分推断把后验近似变成优化问题：在变分族里找一个 KL 散度意义下最接近后验的分布。</li>\n<li>直接最小化 KL 需要算不出的证据，故转而最大化等价的 ELBO，后者只涉及可计算的联合分布与变分分布。</li>\n<li>均场近似高效但假设参数独立，会系统低估不确定性，是 VI 最该警惕的失效模式。</li>\n<li>ADVI 让 VI 黑盒化、开箱即用；归一化流提升变分族表达力；Pathfinder 可作 MCMC 的快速初始化。</li>\n<li>VI 用精度换速度，适合大数据/大模型/实时场景；MCMC 适合精度优先场景；二者可互补拼接。</li>\n<li>得到近似后验后，结论提取仍走<a href=\"../foundations/posterior-inference\">后验推断</a>那套方法，但要对低估的不确定性保持警惕。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"变分推断","id":"变分推断"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"从 KL 散度到 ELBO","id":"从-kl-散度到-elbo"},{"level":2,"text":"均场近似及其代价","id":"均场近似及其代价"},{"level":2,"text":"ADVI、归一化流与 Pathfinder","id":"advi-归一化流与-pathfinder"},{"level":2,"text":"何时用 VI","id":"何时用-vi"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"MCMC 采样","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/bayesian-data-analysis/computation/mcmc"},"next":{"title":"概率编程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/bayesian-data-analysis/computation/probabilistic-programming"}}